== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @boneless chicken thighs{7/20%lb}, @medium yellow onion{1/5} (thinly sliced), @garlic cloves{3/5} (minced), @fresh ginger{1/5%tbsp} (grated), @ground turmeric{2/5%tsp}, @coconut milk or heavy cream{1/5%cup}, @gluten-free chicken broth{1/10%cup}, @olive oil{2/5%tbsp}, @lemon juice{1/5%tbsp}, @cilantro{1/20%cup} (chopped), @Salt + black pepper{}, @?white rice{3/10%cup} (dry).

== Preparation ==

Soften onions and aromatics in a skillet; season chicken thighs with turmeric.

Sear chicken briefly, then simmer with gluten-free broth and cream or coconut milk until chicken reaches 165 F. Finish with cilantro.
